1 71 0 -38 17 -1 0 0 0 1 0 0 0 -1 6589.dat
1 71 0 -21 0 1 0 0 0 0 -1 0 1 0 6589.dat
0 STEP

0 // Step 3: the front cross member: a Technic 2x6 plate in the middle, a Technic 2x8 plate each
